  License : MIT
=============================================================================

Equation :
    s(t) = Ac * [1 + μ * cos(2π*fm*t)] * cos(2π*fc*t)

    where
        Ac  – Carrier amplitude
        μ   – Modulation index  (0 < μ ≤ 1 for standard AM)
        fm  – Message / modulating frequency  (Hz)
        fc  – Carrier frequency               (Hz)
=============================================================================
"""

